00:23:06.748 --> 00:23:08.208
but i don't care

280
00:23:09.128 --> 00:23:10.516
I don't care if you slept with Xu Zhengyin

281
00:23:10.516 --> 00:23:13.216
I don’t care when my uncle is in the hospital
How many people have you slept with?

282
00:23:14.232 --> 00:23:15.332
I said I don't care anymore

283
00:23:15.332 --> 00:23:17.392
X, why are you still like this?

284
00:23:29.648 --> 00:23:33.020
Li Yizhao, stop

285
00:23:35.256 --> 00:23:37.440
If you go out now, you're really done

286
00:23:38.748 --> 00:23:40.624
I mean it

287
00:24:10.672 --> 00:24:11.788
Welcome…

288
00:24:13.984 --> 00:24:15.612
Do you know where Li Yizhao is?

289
00:24:17.508 --> 00:24:18.884
I don't know

290
00:24:19.216 --> 00:24:20.988
Is he at your house?

291
00:24:21.724 --> 00:24:24.056
I also wish he was at my house

292
00:24:24.056 --> 00:24:27.024
If I report missing, everyone will be found out.

293
00:24:27.852 --> 00:24:30.324
Don't embarrass yourself and make it so embarrassing

294
00:24:31.020 --> 00:24:32.776
tell me where is yi zhao

295
00:24:36.388 --> 00:24:37.804
Thank you for visiting

296
00:24:44.028 --> 00:24:45.148
Just now…

297
00:24:47.120 --> 00:24:48.552
I was offended

298
00:24:51.180 --> 00:24:52.740
After Yi Zhao left

299
00:24:53.532 --> 00:24:55.148
I'm going crazy with anxiety

300
00:24:55.788 --> 00:25:00.368
I would feel more at ease if he were at your house

301
00:25:02.944 --> 00:25:05.400
I won't force him to meet me

302
00:25:06.328 --> 00:25:07.976
Just tell me where he is

303
00:25:09.264 --> 00:25:10.692
sit down and chat

304
00:25:16.708 --> 00:25:18.592
What is your sincerity?

305
00:25:20.232 --> 00:25:21.680
what does that mean

306
00:25:22.176 --> 00:25:25.284
-Why is it a photo? -What?

307
00:25:25.932 --> 00:25:29.229
Why is your partner Yizhao?

308
00:25:30.852 --> 00:25:33.084
Do you need any reason to like him?

309
00:25:33.640 --> 00:25:36.384
Don't you know that would hurt Izhao?

310
00:25:40.672 --> 00:25:43.088
I promised no matter what happens

311
00:25:44.508 --> 00:25:45.796
I will always stay by his side

312
00:25:46.656 --> 00:25:47.676
Wrong

313
00:25:48.596 --> 00:25:50.308
You probably can't do it

314
00:25:50.824 --> 00:25:55.596
In addition to a photo, you have many things to protect

315
00:25:56.604 --> 00:25:58.440
So just let the photo go

316
00:26:02.468 --> 00:26:03.324
That...

317
00:26:11.356 --> 00:26:14.384
If you see a photo, please contact me

318
00:26:17.420 --> 00:26:18.476
Please

319
00:26:31.472 --> 00:26:32.608
Mr. Xu Zhenghan

320
00:26:35.688 --> 00:26:36.628
What's wrong

321
00:26:37.604 --> 00:26:40.496
Does my dad even let you spy on me now?

322
00:26:40.984 --> 00:26:42.604
I have something to tell you

323
00:26:46.116 --> 00:26:49.456
The representative wants to transfer you to a director position

324
00:26:50.044 --> 00:26:51.864
He said you have to be responsible for the future of the company

325
00:26:55.520 --> 00:26:57.588
You have your future

326
00:27:01.544 --> 00:27:03.888
I don't want to be your excuse

327
00:27:05.240 --> 00:27:08.108
I plan to eliminate the things that may be used as leverage for you one by one.

328
00:27:10.748 --> 00:27:12.312
Have you met Yizhao?

329
00:27:14.700 --> 00:27:16.948
I'm asking you, have you met Yizhao?

330
00:27:16.948 --> 00:27:20.052
Sorry, I have no comment

331
00:27:24.168 --> 00:27:25.508
what did you say to him

332
00:27:26.608 --> 00:27:27.364
Did you threaten him?

333
00:27:27.364 --> 00:27:28.764
How could I threaten him?

334
00:27:30.736 --> 00:27:32.280
please let go

335
00:27:32.280 --> 00:27:33.508
This is the company

336
00:27:41.176 --> 00:27:45.420
Consider his contribution to the family in the past 9 years

337
00:27:45.420 --> 00:27:47.112
The representative instructed me

338
00:27:47.976 --> 00:27:51.184
On a moral level, give him a condolence payment

339
00:27:52.140 --> 00:27:53.736
Did he accept it?

340
00:27:53.736 --> 00:27:54.504
yes

341
00:27:55.370 --> 00:27:58.964
I quoted an amount that satisfied him and he accepted it.

342
00:28:00.472 --> 00:28:03.184
When he first proposed it, he said he would consider it.

343
00:28:03.184 --> 00:28:06.072
When I called again a few days ago, he agreed.

344
00:28:09.820 --> 00:28:13.200
It seems you have been in contact for some time

345
00:28:17.396 --> 00:28:19.788
If you need money, you can take it from me

346
00:28:21.584 --> 00:28:24.552
Why did Yizhao have to choose such a difficult path?

347
00:28:25.064 --> 00:28:27.060
You seem to have misunderstood

348
00:28:27.060 --> 00:28:28.864
This is obviously a negotiation

349
00:28:31.504 --> 00:28:32.620
your relationship

350
00:28:33.556 --> 00:28:35.436
Not good for each other

351
00:28:37.880 --> 00:28:39.036
You go

352
00:29:01.104 --> 00:29:03.896
(One photo, it’s all my fault)

353
00:29:07.720 --> 00:29:09.600
(I was wrong)
(It's all my fault)

354
00:29:11.437 --> 00:29:13.396
(I failed to protect you)

355
00:29:15.979 --> 00:29:22.646
(One photo I can't live without you)

356
00:29:28.187 --> 00:29:31.187
(Li Yizhao: I have never slept with Xu Zhengyin)

357
00:29:39.108 --> 00:29:41.144
I didn't leave in anger

358
00:29:41.344 --> 00:29:43.328
I left because I didn't want to see you

359
00:29:44.384 --> 00:29:46.056
To break up with you

360
00:29:46.372 --> 00:29:48.272
I'm not finished yet

361
00:29:49.064 --> 00:29:51.380
Do you really not know about Yizhao being threatened?

362
00:29:51.380 --> 00:29:53.592
Does it really have nothing to do with you?

363
00:29:53.592 --> 00:29:56.560
Xu Zhengyin’s foul mouth said this guy’s name

364
00:29:58.764 --> 00:29:59.836
Xu Zhengyin…

